  "description": "Pipeline-driven design for .NET: declare the whole course from raw data to a validated model once, as one artefact, and replay it. The chain is the enforcement — anything that learns from the data is only offered after you have said how to split, so fitting on everything is not a mistake you can make and be warned about later. A declaration written in C# and one written as a file reach equally far, and each is the other read back.",
